fn_mic               "Micrographs (from MotionCorr):"    file       ?               "MicrographGroupMetadata.star.relion" 1               "STAR files (*.star)" required        
; The input STAR file with the micrograph (and their movie metadata) from a MotionCorr job.
;
fn_data              "Particles (from Refine3D or CtfRefine):" file       ?               "ParticleGroupMetadata.star.relion" 1               "STAR files (*.star)" required        "The input STAR file with the metadata of all particles."
fn_post              "Postprocess STAR file:"            file       ?               "ProcessData.star.relion.postprocess" 1               "STAR files (postprocess.star)" required        
; The STAR file generated by a PostProcess job.
The mask used for this postprocessing will be applied to the unfiltered half-maps and should encompass the entire complex.
The resulting FSC curve will be used for weighting the different frequencies.
;
